        "original_id": "69e90295-f19d-5877-ac48-37bb0c88f6df",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Schneider, Tom Wopat, James Best, Tyler Perry, Alicia Witt, Dedee Pfeiffer, Alan Rosenberg, Christine Baranski\n- TV Series: The Dukes of Hazzard, Smallville, The Haves and the Have Nots, Cybill\n- Roles: Beauregard \"Bo\" Duke, Lucas K. \"Luke\" Duke, Jonathan Kent, James \"Jim\" Cryer, Maryann\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wopat first achieved fame for playing Lucas K. \"Luke\" Duke on the television action-comedy series The Dukes of Hazzard.\n- John Schneider is best known for portraying Beauregard \"Bo\" Duke on The Dukes of Hazzard opposite Tom Wopat and James Best.\n- John Schneider is also known for portraying Jonathan Kent in the 2001–2011 television series Smallville, an adaptation of Superman.\n- John Schneider is also known for portraying James \"Jim\" Cryer on the television series The Haves and the Have Nots, which was created by Tyler Perry.\n- In the television series Cybill, Alicia Witt and Dedee Pfeiffer co-starred as Sheridan's daughters.\n- In Cybill, Alan Rosenberg and Tom Wopat played the respective fathers of Sheridan's daughters, and Christine Baranski appeared as Cybill's hard-drinking friend Maryann.",
